  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9bc4902ccea98cf44865aecb61fc1ff4, type: 3}
  m_Name: Soldier
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SuspectData
  FirstName: Soldier
  LastName: 
  Nickname: 
  Occupation: State Security Personnel
  CharacterDescription: "Full uniform, full mask. Doesn't give a name. Doesn't need
    to. Passes through on rotation like every other one of them \u2014 indistinguishable
    by design. Treats the checkpoint as an inconvenience and you as a minor obstacle
    in his day."
  CharacterArc: "Straight-backed, arms at his sides, head tilted just enough to suggest
    he's deciding whether you're worth his time. He's not hostile exactly \u2014
    more like perpetually unimpressed. He follows the process because the state demands
    it, not because he respects it. If you're efficient and professional, something
    shifts slightly. He'll never say so. But he'll stop sighing."
  DateOfBirth: 02/11/1961
  Sex: Male
  EntryPermitExpiryDate: 03 OCT
  IsResident: 1
  GivesPaperwork: 1
  handwritingFont: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f8e89ead54f8523428cc2e34f005bb5e, type: 2}
  startingInfectionScore: 0
  dailyInfectionProgression: {x: 3, y: 8}
  alterEgoName: 
  basePersonalityDescriptors: []
  normalBehaviorNotes: 
  IDPhoto: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 5f05c29b0bf5ab4418daa49fbc3ad0e2, type: 3}
  CharacterPrefab: {fileID: 2613975840466510292, guid: 34daa85d9b002634daf0d037a68a022d, type: 3}
  entryReasons:
    earlyDaysReasons:
    - End of rotation. Standard transit through the civilian checkpoint.
    - Scheduled personnel transfer. You should have the clearance on file.
    - Shift handover. My relief is already at the post.
    midDaysReasons:
    - Extended patrol perimeter. I cross here twice a day now.
    - Security reassignment following the eastern incident. Transit is routine.
    - We've been running double rotations. This is the third crossing today.
    finalDaysReasons:
    - Lockdown rotation. I go where command sends me.
    - Sector reassignment under the emergency order. Papers are current.
    - Standard transit. You'll be seeing a lot of us from now on.
  invalidEntryReasons:
    earlyDaysReasons:
    - I'm here to inspect the inspection. Procedure. You wouldn't know it.
    - Command sent me. The reason is above your clearance level.
    - Routine. You don't need to know what kind.
    midDaysReasons:
    - I came from the other post. The one they closed. I don't know why it's closed.
    - My relief didn't show. I've been here since before the shift started. I think.
    - I was told to cross here. I don't remember who told me.
    finalDaysReasons:
    - I don't know what sector this is anymore. It looked right from the road.
    - My orders were very clear. I have forgotten them but they were very clear.
    - I am returning to a post. I can't remember which one. It doesn't matter.
  entryDialogues:
    lastVerdict: 0
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - Let's make this quick. I have a post to get back to.
    - You going to stare, or are you going to check the papers?
    - Standard transit. You've done this before, I assume.
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - Twice today already. You'd think they'd streamline this.
    - Still running the same process, I see. Fine.
    - Don't ask unnecessary questions. We'll both be happier.
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - Just do what you're supposed to do.
    - I've been through a lot of checkpoints today. This one better be fast.
    - Papers. Stamp. Done. That's all this needs to be.
  uncannyEntryDialogues:
    lastVerdict: 0
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - 
    - 
    - 
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - 
    - 
    - 
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - 
    - 
    - 
  exitDialoguesPassed:
    lastVerdict: 1
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - Good. See, that wasn't so hard.
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - Faster than yesterday. You're learning.
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - Adequate. Keep it up.
  exitDialoguesQuarantined:
    lastVerdict: 2
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - You're detaining state personnel. I hope you know what you're doing.
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - This will be reviewed. I want that noted.
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - ...Fine. I'll wait. But someone is going to hear about this.
  exitDialoguesKilled:
    lastVerdict: 3
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - You just made a very serious mistake.
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - "I didn't think a civilian post would actually \u2014 "
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - Hm. Didn't see that coming from you.
  quarantineExitLines:
  - I will be filing an incident report the moment I am released. That is a promise.
  - Noted. Protested. Being complied with under official objection.
  - Do you have any idea what rank you are detaining right now? Any idea at all?
  killExitLines:
  - "\u2026Didn\u2019t think a post like this would actually follow through\u2026"
  - "For the record\u2026 I still don\u2019t think\u2026 your paperwork\u2026 was
    in order\u2026"
  - "Carry on\u2026 You\u2019re more competent\u2026 than you look\u2026"
  voiceAudioClips:
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: b5302926c0ee68a4fbdf3c2e970e1a3b, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: e0314a5bf871e204fae9c0115d1b7a99, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: d5b9ac78744579844bd9972f6365ffa5, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 26f995c0ca5c195458e373f1fe1f01e2, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: ecc499fb021982b44a03201cf6194eb1, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 02019eb0a67278c44b178287d8d3758c, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: ea2da5791667b5549af6ea56bf46b340, type: 3}
  introDialogue: {fileID: 0}
  questionResponses:
  - question: Where are you coming from?
    earlyDaysAnswer: Patrol route. Nothing that concerns you.
    midDaysAnswer: Perimeter sweep. We extended it east after last week. You'd know
      that if you read the memos.
    finalDaysAnswer: You don't ask soldiers where they've been. Standard transit,
      that's all you need.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: The other checkpoint. The one further north. They sent
      me back but I don't remember why. The route was... different.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: The east post. Which is fine. Still operational. Completely
      operational. I was just there. I think I was just there.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: I was... walking. The road looked right. Command said
      the road would look right and it did. That's all I know.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
  - question: Have you been experiencing any strange symptoms lately?
    earlyDaysAnswer: No. Next question.
    midDaysAnswer: None that I'm required to disclose to civilian personnel. Move
      on.
    finalDaysAnswer: Define strange. Everything is strange now. That's not a symptom,
      that's just the situation.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: No symptoms. I feel very alert. More alert than usual.
      It's been like this for a few days. Very... focused.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: Nothing. My head is clear. Completely clear. There's just
      a sound sometimes but that's nothing. That's not a symptom.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: "I don't feel anything. Is that strange? I used to feel
      things. It\u2019s very quiet now. Inside. Quiet."
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
  - question: Who do you live with?
    earlyDaysAnswer: That's not relevant to transit documentation. Stick to the forms.
    midDaysAnswer: Barracks. Fifteen men. Was fifteen.
    finalDaysAnswer: Nobody asks soldiers that. Are we done?
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: The others. At the barracks. All of them are still there.
      Nothing has changed. You don't need to know their names.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: "Just me now. The others were... reassigned. All at once.
      Very sudden. I don\u2019t know where."
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: I don't know. I go back there and it's dark. It's always
      dark now. I don't know if anyone else is there. I don't check.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
  idleBarks:
    earlyDays:
    - This checkpoint runs three seconds slower than the eastern one. I have timed
      it.
    - Civilian checkpoints waste more time than they save. Not a criticism. An observation.
    - Check the papers. That is all this needs to be.
    midDays:
    - The east post went quiet two days ago. Nobody told me why. I did not ask.
    - Command communication has been intermittent. We operate on last known orders.
    - You are still at your post. Good. Some of them are not.
    finalDays:
    - Orders are still orders when the chain of command is unclear. Proceed.
    - I have been through a lot of checkpoints today. This is the last one I recognize.
    - Do your job, officer. That is all either of us can do now.
    uncannyEarlyDays: []
    uncannyMidDays: []
    uncannyFinalDays: []
  IDNumber: 6391819
